get.description:
Returns the grid's (this backend process's) start time and uptime in
seconds, based on the in-memory start timestamp recorded at startup;
returns nulls if the grid hasn't been marked as started yet.

UpdateNodePermissionsRequest.description:
The request body. ``permissions`` carries one bool per catalog category;
``auto_commit`` mirrors the other node writers (True from the workflow
builder, False from the scripting page).
